<view class="page"><nav-bar title="教我一件小事"></nav-bar><view class="content"><text class="kicker">LITTLE CLASS</text><text class="title">想教我什么？</text><text class="desc">你的选择会轻轻影响我破壳后的性格。</text><view class="options"><view wx:for="{{options}}" wx:key="value" class="option {{selected === item.value ? 'option--selected' : ''}}" data-value="{{item.value}}" bindtap="onSelect"><view class="icon">{{item.icon}}</view><text>{{item.value}}</text><text class="arrow">{{selected === item.value ? '✓' : '›'}}</text></view></view><view class="spacer"></view><button class="primary {{!selected ? 'primary--disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="onSubmit"><text class="button-label">把这件小事教给我</text></button></view></view>
